Z||000001||Fierotech||12-30-2001||02:22 AM||||That'd be a Getrag 5speed, with a Quad4 specific bellhousing. If you change the bellhousing out with a Fiero one, and swap the metal speedo reluctor ring out for a Fiero plastic gear on the diff, and get Rodney's FWD adapter kit, it'll work fine in a Fiero.<P>Jeremy B.||||reg||1
